# The settings page, which stands in for everything below the main window's title bar.
# Each page in place, then the folders restored. Run it again with --size 900x480 to see a page
# taller than the window scroll.

settings general
shot 01-general
settings appearance
shot 02-appearance
settings preview
shot 03-preview
settings search-index
shot 04-search-index
settings history
shot 05-history
settings new-items
shot 06-new-items
settings columns
shot 07-columns
settings context-menu
shot 08-context-menu
settings close
shot 09-back-to-folders

# --- Live apply. There is no Save: a box ticked on the page reaches the folders once the page's
# debounce has run, and leaving straight after a change still writes it (the flush on close). ---

tree .
refresh
assert-no-row .hidden-notes.txt
settings general
settings tick Show hidden items on
settle 800
settings close
assert-row .hidden-notes.txt

settings general
settings tick Show hidden items off
settings close
assert-no-row .hidden-notes.txt
